# Yasvik weekly growth check (30 min)

When asked for a weekly growth check, pull numbers and propose at most **3** fixes. Do not redesign the storefront.

## Sources

1. **GBP Insights:** calls, direction requests, website clicks
2. **Google Search Console:** impressions/clicks for `cold pressed oil Hyderabad`, `dry fruits Chanda Nagar`, brand `Yasvik`
3. **Merchant Center** free listings: impressions/clicks (feed `https://www.yasvik.com/catalog/meta-feed.csv`)
4. **Site analytics:** sessions + WhatsApp click events

## Output

Compare to last week. List next 3 actions only (prefer GBP photos/reviews/posts and Hero PDP content over code).
